{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e29cf993516a4894331296d385f9aea360d3d5a8640a2a8a8b6600ef9110f5d5", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n静香もやる気充分のはずだったが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。静香应该也干劲十足才对，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "ed977988960994f9706edc8e20384a3c435d976c252aa7c56fcbe92d17440d97", "ja": "……うーん、どうしよう……。", "zh": "……唔——该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b66c45e3fdfa1aed85d678df85895fab579123f99d585f3945915857d1bfa3ce", "ja": "静香、何かあったのか？", "zh": "静香，发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "aac933dcc90c6bc0ae8224085ac54f1cd70252b0fcbfd2070b08b30a072a8b5f", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……。その今回の撮影の\nテーマは『ふんわりリラックスタイム』ですよね？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……这次拍摄的主题是“轻松惬意时光”，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "8586627eb8f03cd99bb2f9339297ed7b9370daa24b8762f677563655f55d8881", "ja": "衣装もふわふわなパジャマですし、雰囲気や\n表情作りも、テーマに合わせてみようと思うんです。", "zh": "衣装是蓬松的睡衣，所以我想在氛围\n和表情上，也试着配合主题来呈现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c5e6df501a312f136510b20da2565d53fa3dc4845812763d19ca46ece9e4df3", "ja": "いいと思うよ。普段とのギャップも見えて、\nファンの人も新鮮に思うかもな。", "zh": "我觉得挺好的。这样也能展现出和平时不同的一面，粉丝们可能也会觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "897212e701f8e110cb499a9f83fcaaf7b8a203c538423d47e2659e38c1aeab9a", "ja": "そう言ってもらえて安心しました。でも、\nそのふわふわな感じをどう表現しようかなって……。", "zh": "听你这么说我就放心了。不过，我在想该怎么表现出那种轻飘飘的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "c367bab1900ddadbfdfc61273b6c336cbe8344cf2f6aec5fa2498ef95b04ba49", "ja": "一度、ふわふわしたものに囲まれたら、\n何か掴めるんじゃないかと思ったんです。", "zh": "我想过，要是能被柔软蓬松的东西包围一次，说不定就能抓住些什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8408b0762becba296a6ceb20f482d88a136dfc7b1c33e64bdeace92017eb2883", "ja": "ふわふわしたもの……？", "zh": "软绵绵的东西……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "8729d795fb93cb37b66412d3e214935c58c4d432f6ab6e3cbe95184a9082fb9e", "ja": "はい。ここにあるものでって思って……スタッフさんに\n「試しにベッドに寝てもいいか」相談してみたんです。", "zh": "是的。我想着就用这里现有的东西……所以去问了工作人员，能不能试着躺到床上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1010_p", "source_sha256": "00952c13e1e9b44d1313c4d532879da1535b3a0134f6e61c37ccc2c86356a416", "ja": "い、いつの間に……。\nそれで、どうだった？", "zh": "什、什么时候……  \n然后，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "5b5770321cb41c84d4849ba0f4585235244bc2f0365206c72445b94d6cf86bbc", "ja": "……ベッドは柔らかくて寝心地がいいし、\nたくさん置かれたふわふわのぬいぐるみも可愛くて。", "zh": "……床很软，睡起来很舒服，\n摆得满满的毛绒玩偶也很可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "0766ad19f7f9339baea40784eb6a133c5371c0cd2f724efb9d02729379b00aa6", "ja": "気づいたら、心も身体もリラックスしてました！\n本気で寝てしまいそうになるくらい……。", "zh": "回过神来，身心都放松下来了！\n甚至差点就要真的睡着了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d6b6e63fdfa6b86d8d9c931a5b8e063bbac14106033ddaf141b3c2dd5817276e", "ja": "ははっ。よかったじゃないか。それなら撮影もバッチリ\n……ん？　なんで難しい顔をしてたんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，那不是挺好的吗？这样一来拍摄也能顺利完成了……嗯？你刚才为什么一脸严肃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "7e6c8e3423fbe0bda02cbf5c1f6aea798a272ce8ffc447eafae4f9bbfd521cee", "ja": "うっ。それは、その……。", "zh": "呜。那个，是因为……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "20c301cbbe4d74f944640df362768db1e7381d49432ee2451f482b8a6544171d", "ja": "ほ、本番中にだらしない姿を見せないか心配なんです！\nうっかり寝顔を撮られたら、恥ずかしすぎます……。", "zh": "我、我是担心会在正式演出中露出懒散的样子！\n要是一不小心被拍到睡脸，就太难为情了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c1960b19a1a4c5881dea63a6c117b7081315f07df9ce34f0f0a856c87e8a3d42", "ja": "別にいいと思うぞ。\nそれもリラックスした姿ではあるからな。", "zh": "我觉得没什么不好的。\n毕竟那也是放松状态的一种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "9490c49747a2e3cf7e71f61ee0f9fc36740c72a4bbac2771b718b93a4029ee51", "ja": "なっ！？　た、確かに、そう……ですけど！\nわかりました。私も、覚悟を決めて撮影に臨みます！", "zh": "什！？确、确实是这样……没错，可是！  \n我明白了。我也会做好觉悟，投入拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0523_1018_p", "source_sha256": "98657d271eb3fbf8d8a33715d24465b1916027eb56ab73d62357fc5b3a5546e2", "ja": "（宣言どおり、本番中に静香が寝ることはなかった。\nウトウトしていた気もしたが、心にしまっておこう）", "zh": "（静香果然没有在正式拍摄时睡着。\n虽然感觉她好像打了会儿瞌睡，但还是把这件事藏在心里吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
